    <layout>
      <region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center"/>
    </layout>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:10.800" end="00:14.670" ttm:agent="v1">I go a 100 miles per hour I don't care about the speed limit</p>
      <p begin="00:14.670" end="00:16.870" ttm:agent="v1">I'll crash the car you'll have to deal with it</p>
      <p begin="00:16.870" end="00:20.270" ttm:agent="v1">You were the only one I cared for now I go against the speed limit</p>
      <p begin="00:20.270" end="00:22.680" ttm:agent="v1">I'm half asleep but I still deal with it</p>
      <p begin="00:22.680" end="00:25.630" ttm:agent="v1">I see red and blue now this can't be</p>
      <p begin="00:25.630" end="00:28.210" ttm:agent="v1">Am I hallucinating cause I can't breathe</p>
      <p begin="00:28.210" end="00:31.140" ttm:agent="v1">I thought that it was you riding beside me</p>
      <p begin="00:31.140" end="00:33.800" ttm:agent="v1">But now I'm all alone with just my car keys</p>
      <p begin="00:33.800" end="00:36.530" ttm:agent="v1">2:45 AM</p>
      <p begin="00:36.530" end="00:39.730" ttm:agent="v1">Why are we still here again?</p>
      <p begin="00:39.730" end="00:42.650" ttm:agent="v1">You wanna argue let's go back inside</p>
      <p begin="00:42.650" end="00:45.340" ttm:agent="v1">Keep it on the low cause I don't wanna fight</p>
      <p begin="00:45.340" end="00:47.620" ttm:agent="v1">A blue dress a white car and a cocktail</p>
      <p begin="00:47.620" end="00:50.870" ttm:agent="v1">Is what you want, I know that's what you want girl</p>
      <p begin="00:50.870" end="00:53.880" ttm:agent="v1">You show off you know that I'm attached girl</p>
      <p begin="00:53.880" end="00:56.560" ttm:agent="v1">It's what you want, I know that's what you want girl</p>
      <p begin="00:56.560" end="00:59.790" ttm:agent="v1">You said you loved me now you say you hate me now</p>
      <p begin="00:59.790" end="01:02.480" ttm:agent="v1">Don't know what is true</p>
      <p begin="01:02.480" end="01:05.060" ttm:agent="v1">You said the shit that we went through ain't deep</p>
      <p begin="01:05.060" end="01:08.080" ttm:agent="v1">But babe as you cried I was there when you needed me</p>
      <p begin="01:08.080" end="01:11.750" ttm:agent="v1">I go a 100 miles per hour I don't care about the speed limit</p>
      <p begin="01:11.750" end="01:13.820" ttm:agent="v1">I'll crash the car you'll have to deal with it</p>
      <p begin="01:13.820" end="01:17.330" ttm:agent="v1">You were the only one I cared for now I go against the speed limit</p>
      <p begin="01:17.330" end="01:20.090" ttm:agent="v1">I'm half asleep but I still deal with it</p>
      <p begin="01:20.090" end="01:22.680" ttm:agent="v1">I see red and blue now this can't be</p>
      <p begin="01:22.680" end="01:25.650" ttm:agent="v1">Am I hallucinating cause I can't breathe</p>
      <p begin="01:25.650" end="01:28.260" ttm:agent="v1">I thought that it was you riding beside me</p>
      <p begin="01:28.260" end="01:30.760" ttm:agent="v1">But now I'm all alone with just my car keys</p>
      <p begin="01:30.760" end="01:33.650" ttm:agent="v1">Everyone thinks that I'm fucked in the head</p>
      <p begin="01:33.650" end="01:36.510" ttm:agent="v1">They must not realize that you were instead</p>
      <p begin="01:36.510" end="01:39.260" ttm:agent="v1">All of those years acting like you're attached</p>
      <p begin="01:39.260" end="01:42.120" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me behind he leaves you in his bed</p>
      <p begin="01:42.120" end="01:45.180" ttm:agent="v1">Two hour drive babe</p>
      <p begin="01:45.180" end="01:48.040" ttm:agent="v1">I'll be there right away</p>
      <p begin="01:48.040" end="01:50.980" ttm:agent="v1">You got me tied up but</p>
      <p begin="01:50.980" end="01:53.610" ttm:agent="v1">I want you anyway</p>
      <p begin="01:53.610" end="01:56.240" ttm:agent="v1">Babe you're not even sober don't talk</p>
      <p begin="01:56.240" end="01:59.430" ttm:agent="v1">Speech is delayed you don't know what you're on</p>
      <p begin="01:59.430" end="02:02.110" ttm:agent="v1">Tell all your friends that you haven't moved on</p>
      <p begin="02:02.110" end="02:05.360" ttm:agent="v1">Go with another you cope with my</p>
      <p begin="02:05.360" end="02:09.060" ttm:agent="v1">I go a 100 miles per hour I don't care about the speed limit</p>
      <p begin="02:09.060" end="02:11.160" ttm:agent="v1">I'll crash the car you'll have to deal with it</p>
      <p begin="02:11.160" end="02:14.610" ttm:agent="v1">You were the only one I cared for now I go against the speed limit</p>
      <p begin="02:14.610" end="02:17.080" ttm:agent="v1">I'm half asleep but I still deal with it</p>
      <p begin="02:17.080" end="02:19.420" ttm:agent="v1">I see red and blue now this can't be</p>
      <p begin="02:19.420" end="02:22.690" ttm:agent="v1">Am I hallucinating cause I can't breathe</p>
      <p begin="02:22.690" end="02:25.640" ttm:agent="v1">I thought that it was you riding beside me</p>
      <p begin="02:25.640" end="02:27.730" ttm:agent="v1">But now I'm all alone with just my car keys</p>
      <p begin="02:27.730" end="02:30.980" ttm:agent="v1">Everyone thinks that I'm fucked in the head</p>
      <p begin="02:30.980" end="02:33.600" ttm:agent="v1">They must not realize that you were instead</p>
      <p begin="02:33.600" end="02:36.510" ttm:agent="v1">All of those years acting like you're attached</p>
      <p begin="02:36.510" end="02:39.420" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me behind he leaves you in his bed</p>
      <p begin="02:39.420" end="02:43.430" ttm:agent="v1">I go a 100 miles per hour I don't care about the speed limit</p>
      <p begin="02:43.430" end="02:46.130" ttm:agent="v1">I'll crash the car you'll have to deal with it</p>
      <p begin="02:46.130" end="02:49.810" ttm:agent="v1">You were the only one I cared for now I go against the speed limit</p>
      <p begin="02:49.810" end="02:52.290" ttm:agent="v1">I'm half asleep but I still deal with it</p>
      <p begin="02:52.290" end="02:55.470" ttm:agent="v1">I see red and blue now this can't be</p>
      <p begin="02:55.470" end="02:58.670" ttm:agent="v1">Am I hallucinating cause I can't breathe</p>
      <p begin="02:58.670" end="03:01.540" ttm:agent="v1">I thought that it was you riding beside me</p>
      <p begin="03:01.540" end="03:04.720" ttm:agent="v1">But now I'm all alone with just my car keys</p>
      <p begin="03:04.720" end="03:07.670" ttm:agent="v1">Everyone thinks that I'm fucked in the head</p>
      <p begin="03:07.670" end="03:10.820" ttm:agent="v1">They must not realize that you were instead</p>
      <p begin="03:10.820" end="03:14.130" ttm:agent="v1">All of those years acting like you're attached</p>
      <p begin="03:14.130" end="03:17.840" ttm:agent="v1">Leave me behind he leaves you in his bed</p>
